                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is fantastic. It has an addictive gameplay loop like something out of WarioWare while having an engaging story to match. It has strong commentary on mental health and does an excellent job showing the consequences of your actions whether your intentions were good or not. There are multiple endings that follow through with the expansive choices you make when playing. The dialogue to can be downright silly at times, yet it still manages to be meaningful. I highly recommend this game. It's short enough to finish in one day and for the price, it feels like a no brainer to buy (especially on sale).",
